%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0bf90f96773687418d2d0ad8d599d18, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeSlotCatalog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kismeta.UI::Kismeta.UI.Narrative.NarrativeSlotCatalog
  _entries:
  - _id: game.overview
    _season: 0
    _tier: 0
    _order: -1
    _beat: Journey through Cosmic Ages. Align with each sign, forge your stone, and
      reach the Altar.
    _charge: Align with each Cosmic Age; work with or defend against Rivals; complete
      all four Crucible Cards and reach the Altar.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Determine the Agekeeper
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.intro
    _season: 0
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: A new age dawns. Set the sign, claim your place on the wheel, and gather
      your harvest.
    _charge: 'Open the round: set the cosmic age, find your sign, and gather your
      harvest.'
    _stakes: "This age's sign shapes everything \u2014 which cards harvest well,
      which alignments score, and your own cosmic effect for the round."
    _verbs:
    - Begin Spring
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.focus
    _season: 0
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: 
    _charge: "Before cards lock, use your tools \u2014 read effects, commune, and
      check whether an Astral House is worth building."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Focus
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.setage
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: Roll the Cosmic Age die, and let the heavens set this round's Sign for
      all.
    _charge: "Roll the Cosmic Age die \u2014 one of twelve signs sets this round's
      Sign, Planet, and Element."
    _stakes: These three Aspects govern every harvest bonus and alignment all round.
    _verbs:
    - Cast The Age
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.sign
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Roll your Zodiac die and take your sign. The cosmos marks you for this
      age.
    _charge: "Roll your Zodiac die and move your meeple to your sign \u2014 your
      identity for this round."
    _stakes: Your sign is an alignment source AND grants a personal cosmic effect
      that lasts until Winter.
    _verbs:
    - Roll Your Zodiac Die
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.harvest
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Tally your alignment bonuses and take your harvest from the Agekeeper.
    _charge: Tally your bonus from every source, then take your full harvest from
      the Agekeeper.
    _stakes: Sign +3, Planet +2, Element +1.
    _verbs:
    - Deal & Commune
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.hub
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Study the wheel. Commune, build a House, and prepare for Summer.
    _charge: Commune with your cards, build an Astral House on your sign, and review
      the table before Summer.
    _stakes: Spread cards score alignment and activate Crucibles but can be stolen
      in a Duel. Hand cards are safe but idle.
    _verbs:
    - Commune With Cards
    - Build A House
    - Proceed To Summer
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.passed
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: You yielded the wheel, and spring waits on your rivals.
    _charge: Spring ends when every player passes in a row without acting.
    _stakes: You will be asked to respond if a rival's action requires your input.
    _verbs:
    - Waiting
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.commune
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Sort your fortune. Place cards in Spread, Hand, and Arcanum.
    _charge: Sort your cards into Spread (visible engine) and Hand (hidden reserve).
      Major Arcana go to your Arcanum.
    _stakes: Spread cards score alignment and activate Crucibles but can be stolen
      in a Duel. Hand cards are safe but idle.
    _verbs:
    - Lock The Tableau
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.buildhouse
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Raise a House on your sign. Pay one planet-matching card and anchor the
      sky.
    _charge: "Pay 1 card matching your sign's planet to raise a House on your current
      sign \u2014 a permanent harvest source and cosmic effect."
    _stakes: "Houses are permanent \u2014 the card is spent for good. You may only
      build on the sign you rolled this round."
    _verbs:
    - Raise The House
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.lock
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: Lock your tableau. Spread and Hand freeze until Winter releases them.
    _charge: "Confirm your placement \u2014 cards freeze between Spread and Hand
      until Winter."
    _stakes: Over-load your Spread and you expose value to theft; under-load it and
      you starve your engine. This is binding.
    _verbs:
    - "Lock \U0001F512"
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.intro
    _season: 1
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: The sun rides high. Craft, activate, trade, duel, gambit, and oppose as
      you will.
    _charge: "Take any actions, in any order, as many as you can fuel \u2014 no fixed
      order, no turn limit."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Begin Summer
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.focus
    _season: 1
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: 
    _charge: "This round is for consorting and contesting \u2014 review Codex and
      the Table, then Trade, Duel, Gambit, and Opposition as opportunities arise."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Focus
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.hub
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: Take your turn beneath the high sun. Craft, consort, or activate.
    _charge: Take any actions, in any order, as many as you can fuel.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Craft
    - Consort
    - Activate
    - Finish Turn
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.passed
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: You yielded the contest, and the high sun waits on your rivals.
    _charge: Summer ends when every player passes in a row without acting.
    _stakes: You will be asked to respond if a rival's action requires your input.
    _verbs:
    - Waiting
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.activate
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Activate a Crucible. Complete its Codex formula and light the cauldron.
    _charge: Collect a Codex card set in your Spread, discard it, light the matching
      cauldron, and flip the Crucible card face-up.
    _stakes: "The coal can never be moved once placed \u2014 light the cauldron your
      higher-tier cards will demand."
    _verbs:
    - Activate
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.craft
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Craft a reagent. Feed three suit-matched cards into a lit cauldron.
    _charge: "Discard 3 suit-matching cards into a lit cauldron to craft 1 elemental
      reagent. Salt needs no cauldron \u2014 any 3 cards."
    _stakes: Reagents only transfer by Trade. Each elemental type needs its own cauldron
      lit first.
    _verbs:
    - Forge
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.buildhouse
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Raise a House on your sign. Pay two planet-matching cards and stake the
      sky.
    _charge: "Pay 2 cards matching your sign's planet to raise a House \u2014 a permanent
      harvest source, opposition boost, and cosmic effect."
    _stakes: "Houses are permanent \u2014 the cards are spent for good and cannot
      be reclaimed. Build deliberately."
    _verbs:
    - Raise The House
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.wards
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: Set your wards. Place reagents on Active cards before rivals come.
    _charge: Place reagents on your Active Crucible or Adept cards to set the fee
      challengers must pay to Gambit them.
    _stakes: Crucible wards are permanent; Adept wards return if the Adept leaves
      play. An unwarded active card can be gambited for free.
    _verbs:
    - Seal The Wards
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.trade
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 6
    _beat: Strike a bargain. Exchange cards, reagents, or Active Crucibles with a
      rival.
    _charge: "Exchange cards, reagents, or Active Crucible cards freely with a rival
      \u2014 the only way to move reagents."
    _stakes: Hidden Hand cards cannot be requested. In Magnus mode, misaligned players
      trade 2:1.
    _verbs:
    - Complete Trade
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.duel
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 7
    _beat: Duel for a Spread card. Ante your own and roll against a rival.
    _charge: "Name a card in a rival's Spread, ante a card of your own, and roll
      \u2014 higher roll takes the prize."
    _stakes: Lose, and your ante returns to the deck. Only Spread cards can be targeted;
      the Hand is safe.
    _verbs:
    - Ante & Roll
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.gambit
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 8
    _beat: Gambit a rival's Active card. Pay their ward fee and roll for the prize.
    _charge: Stake one of your Active cards to seize a rival's Crucible or Adept
      card. Pay their ward fee, then roll.
    _stakes: "Lose, and your offered card is Arrested \u2014 pay 1 Salt to free it,
      and you can't re-gambit that rival this round."
    _verbs:
    - Challenge This Rival
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: autumn.intro
    _season: 2
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: The crucible runs hot. Craft, activate, fire your stone, and drive it
      toward gold.
    _charge: "Take any actions, in any order, as many as you can fuel \u2014 craft,
      activate, and advance at the forge."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Begin Autumn
    _breadcrumb: Forging
  - _id: autumn.focus
    _season: 2
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: 
    _charge: "The forge is live \u2014 cross-check Codex costs before you Fire, Temper,
      or break Stasis."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Focus
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: autumn.survey
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: Read the forge before you move.
    _charge: "Note every stone's position \u2014 Mantle (safe), Forge (vulnerable),
      Stasis (frozen), or the Altar."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Survey
    _breadcrumb: Survey
  - _id: autumn.passed
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: You stepped back from the flames. The forge still burns for your rivals.
    _charge: Autumn ends when every player passes in a row without acting.
    _stakes: You will be asked to respond if a rival's action requires your input.
    _verbs:
    - Waiting
    _breadcrumb: Waiting
  - _id: summer.opposition
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 9
    _beat: Align against a rival and break their forging.
    _charge: Pay the defender's ward fee, roll, and total your Aspect alignment.
      Win, and their stone falls to Stasis.
    _stakes: "Each defense the rival survives grants them a stacking Besieged Bonus
      \u2014 a dogpile on the leader can backfire."
    _verbs:
    - Oppose
    _breadcrumb: Opposing
  - _id: autumn.fire
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Commit your stone to the flames.
    _charge: "Satisfy an Active Crucible card's formula \u2014 alignment + reagents
      \u2014 and advance your stone into the forge."
    _stakes: A stone Fired this Autumn is safe this round, but Forging next round
      leaves it open to Opposition. Ward as you advance.
    _verbs:
    - Fire
    _breadcrumb: Forging
  - _id: autumn.temper
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Temper your stone. Advance it to the next Mantle and seal this stage.
    _charge: Advance a stone that has forged a full round to the next Mantle space
      and discard its Crucible card.
    _stakes: "A stone that returned from Stasis this round cannot Temper yet \u2014
      it must forge a full round first."
    _verbs:
    - Temper
    _breadcrumb: Tempering
  - _id: autumn.leavestasis
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: Leave Stasis. Pay Salt and return your stone to the forge.
    _charge: Pay 2 Salt to return your stone to its old forge position and resume
      forging.
    _stakes: If your old position is taken, you must wait a round or win a Stasis
      Opposition to swap into it.
    _verbs:
    - Leave Stasis
    _breadcrumb: In Stasis
  - _id: winter.intro
    _season: 3
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: The long night settles in. Unlock, wager, trim your hand, and turn the
      wheel.
    _charge: 'Close the age: unlock your cards, place an optional wager, enforce
      limits, and transit to the next age.'
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Begin Winter
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.focus
    _season: 3
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: 
    _charge: "The age is closing \u2014 reorganize, wager wisely, and trim to limits
      before transit."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Focus
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.unlock
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: Unlock your cards. Move freely between Hand and Spread one last time.
    _charge: Move cards freely between Hand and Spread one last time before the age
      closes.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Unlock Cards
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.wager
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Bet on the sign the coming age will wear.
    _charge: Predict the next cosmic sign and stake any cards from your Spread or
      Hand. Guess right and your wager doubles.
    _stakes: Guess wrong and the cards are lost to the Fates. Major Arcana in your
      Arcanum cannot be wagered.
    _verbs:
    - Place Wager
    - Skip Wager
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.limits
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Enforce your limits. Discard down to five Spread and five Hand.
    _charge: Discard down to 5 Spread and 5 Hand. Return all Fate cards to the deck;
      Adepts remain.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Enforce Limits
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.transit
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: Turn the wheel. Pass the key and begin the next Cosmic Age.
    _charge: "The Agekeeper shuffles the deck and passes the key clockwise \u2014
      a new age begins, unless the Great Work is done."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Turn The Wheel
    - Cast The Next Age
    _breadcrumb: 
